            "review_text": "fitnfifty\nBrisbane, Australia149 contributions\n0\nReturn visit\nMay 2018 • Couples\nHanoi Food is a small popular restaurant on a busy street. My family and I have eaten here on a previuos trip so my husband and I decided to go back again this year. We were not disappointed our meal was delicious. Tofu in lemongrass, carmelised pork rice and the best lime ice drink I have had and I have had a few just the thing on hot day. Medium prices from 50,000 vnd to 300,000 vnd\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 5, 2018",
