            "review_text": "geelongexpat\nMelbourne, Australia1576 contributions\n0\nPoor\nFeb 2018 • Solo\nI chose to have the seafood pho here for dinner. While the staff were helpful, the pho was forgettable. One prawn and 2 pieces of octopus. I have sampled fresher seafood in other parts of Vietnam too. There was also an excessive amount of coriander in the meal as well. Cost was 50000 dong + drinks. I would walk past this restaurant if I had my time again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 26, 2018",
